@startuml
title sd — UC5 Autonomous bench reception (A1–A6)
actor Operator
participant "Application loop" as App
participant BurstRunner as Burst
participant BenchController as Control
participant "TWAI adapter" as CAN
Operator -> App : power up isolated bench
loop Countdown (no USB required)
  App -> Burst : service(now)
end
App -> Burst : tick(now >= boot + 10000 ms)
Burst -> Control : start_immediately(now)
Control -> CAN : initialize/start
loop Up to 10 attempts while no fault or cancellation
  App -> Burst : service(now), commands, tick(now)
  Burst -> Control : service(now), tick if below limit
  Control -> CAN : poll results / submit due single-shot
  CAN --> Control : accepted, completion or error
end
Burst -> Control : stop after final completion or cancellation
Control -> CAN : cleanup
note over Burst, Control
Errors stop through existing controller policy.
BurstRunner never re-arms without an MCU reset.
USB reconnection does not schedule another series.
end note
@enduml
